Package: nwauR
Type: Package
Title: R Wrapper for the 'NWAU' Python Command Line Interface
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("MCHS", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "opensource@example.com")
Author: MCHS [aut, cre]
Maintainer: MCHS <opensource@example.com>
Description: Provides a lightweight R interface to the separately distributed
    'nwau-py' Python command line interface. The package exchanges CSV files
    with Python so calculation logic remains in the Python implementation.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: false
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Suggests: testthat
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.9) and the 'nwau-py' Python package
